{"id":"00304","root":"uni00304_1","name":{"ja":"井河　さくら","en":"Igawa Sakura"},"title":{"ja":"【超音速ベーシスト】","en":"【Supersonic Bassist】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【超音速ベーシスト】 井河　さくら","en":"【Supersonic Bassist】 Igawa Sakura"},"aliases":["Demon Sakura"],"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-03-16","limited":true,"characterId":27,"profile":{"ja":"次元侵略者ブレインフレーヤーによる騒動に巻き込まれ、こちらの世界に来てしまった別次元のさくら。教師をしているこちらの世界本来のさくらとは違い、まだ五車学園の学生である。単身こちらの世界に飛ばされた上に、元凶のブレインフレーヤーが消滅して戻れなくなってしまった。仕方がないのでふうま家に居候しながら、こちらの世界のさくらと遭遇しないように注意しつつ、もとの世界に戻る方法を探している。ゲームのし過ぎで時子にしばらくゲームを没収され、暇つぶしに家の中を漁っていた所、放置されていたエレキベースを発見。それをきっかけにベースの演奏にハマっていった。とうとうアルバイト代を溜めてまで自分のベースを購入し、一日中飽きずに弾いている。いつか元の世界に戻れたら、姉のアサギや友人の紫とバンドを組んでみたいなぁ……などとと思いながら。","en":"(Igawa Sakura, she/her) Sakura from another dimension was caught up in the chaos caused by the interdimensional invader Brain Freayer and ended up in this world. Unlike the Sakura who works as a teacher here, she is still a student at Gosha Academy. After being thrust alone into this world, the source of the trouble, Brain Freayer, vanished, leaving her unable to return. With no other choice, she has been staying as a lodger with the Fuuma family while carefully avoiding any encounters with this world's Sakura and searching for a way back to her own world. After Tokiko confiscated her games for a while, she was rummaging around the house for something to do and discovered an abandoned electric bass. That sparked her passion for playing bass, and she eventually saved up enough from part-time work to buy her own instrument, which she now plays all day without getting bored. She dreams that, if she ever makes it back home, she'll form a band with her sister Asagi and her friend Murasaki…"},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"黒岩心々","forms":[{"id":"uni00304_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1224,2448],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[177,354],"def":[133,266],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skil